      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{628d00a6b624bb0b622328ef|full_name}\n\nYes, reuploading solved the issue and Quest/Mobile users were able to join again without being send back to their home world instantly.\n\nI'm not sure if anything else got corrupted, I just noticed Mobile platforms were no longer able to join after the server outage, despite not having uploaded a new build in a month or two, when re-uploading everything functioned as intended again.",
